WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.875 --> 00:00:30.208
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:30.916
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:30.916 --> 00:00:34.708
described some qualities of an ideal devotee.

4
00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:38.166
Now, continuing that description,

5
00:00:38.166 --> 00:00:40.041
He explains some more

6
00:00:40.041 --> 00:00:43.125
qualities of an ideal devotee.

7
00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:49.875
In this verse, Lord Krishna

8
00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:50.750
mentions a

9
00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:53.666
very important quality,

10
00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:56.708
and that is samata, meaning

11
00:00:56.708 --> 00:00:59.541
balance and steadiness.

12
00:00:59.541 --> 00:01:00.500
A true devotee

13
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.791
neither disturbs anyone else, nor

14
00:01:03.791 --> 00:01:05.291
is disturbed by

15
00:01:05.291 --> 00:01:07.791
the behaviour of others.

16
00:01:07.791 --> 00:01:11.833
This is what makes this verse of the Gita special.

17
00:01:11.833 --> 00:01:14.500
Yasman nodvijate loko,

18
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.833
these words of the verse mean

19
00:01:16.833 --> 00:01:19.916
not causing distress to anyone,

20
00:01:19.916 --> 00:01:23.250
and then, lokan nodvijate ca yah.

21
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:26.125
This means not becoming agitated or

22
00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:29.458
troubled by the behaviour of others.

23
00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:31.166
That is, such a devotee

24
00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:34.458
causes no pain to anyone, and at the same time

25
00:01:34.458 --> 00:01:38.250
is not agitated by the behaviour of others.

26
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:41.791
These two aspects, not causing pain to others,

27
00:01:41.791 --> 00:01:43.541
and remaining steady within,

28
00:01:43.541 --> 00:01:46.791
form the distinct identity of a devotee.

29
00:01:46.791 --> 00:01:50.375
In today's world, where people
are constantly in worry,

30
00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:53.875
envy, fear, and expectations,

31
00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:57.833
an ideal devotee is free from all of these.

32
00:01:57.833 --> 00:02:02.125
They are not affected by
others' criticism or blame,

33
00:02:02.125 --> 00:02:03.625
because such a devotee's mind

34
00:02:03.625 --> 00:02:06.416
is fixed in Lord Krishna.

35
00:02:06.416 --> 00:02:08.666
No external situation, good

36
00:02:08.666 --> 00:02:12.708
or bad, disturbs them.

37
00:02:12.708 --> 00:02:15.208
Next, Lord Krishna mentions four such emotional

38
00:02:15.208 --> 00:02:19.000
states that ordinarily

39
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.166
unsettle the mind.

40
00:02:22.166 --> 00:02:24.291
First, “Harsh”

41
00:02:24.291 --> 00:02:27.833
when something desired or a success comes,

42
00:02:27.833 --> 00:02:29.875
a person loses their steady mind

43
00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:32.416
in that joy.

44
00:02:32.416 --> 00:02:36.791
But an ideal devotee does not do this.

45
00:02:36.791 --> 00:02:38.750
Second, “Amarsh”

46
00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:42.500
meaning envy, feeling envious seeing

47
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:43.958
others' success.

48
00:02:43.958 --> 00:02:47.750
A devotee finds joy in others' happiness too,

49
00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:51.500
so the question of envy does not arise.

50
00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:53.666
Third, “Bhay”

51
00:02:53.666 --> 00:02:56.166
the fear of losing something.

52
00:02:56.166 --> 00:02:57.458
A devotee knows

53
00:02:57.458 --> 00:02:59.958
that everything is in Lord Krishna's hands.

54
00:02:59.958 --> 00:03:02.375
What is theirs will come to them.

55
00:03:02.375 --> 00:03:05.000
What is not theirs will not last.

56
00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.875
So what is there to fear?

57
00:03:07.875 --> 00:03:10.250
Fourth, “Vyakulta”

58
00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.375
which ordinarily

59
00:03:11.375 --> 00:03:14.041
arises from worry about the future.

60
00:03:14.041 --> 00:03:15.291
A devotee knows

61
00:03:15.291 --> 00:03:17.708
that Lord Krishna Himself is their protector.

62
00:03:17.708 --> 00:03:20.958
So what need is there for worry?

63
00:03:20.958 --> 00:03:22.500
These four emotions,

64
00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:23.583
which ordinarily

65
00:03:23.583 --> 00:03:26.666
make a person unstable and worried,

66
00:03:26.666 --> 00:03:29.500
have no effect on a devotee.

67
00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:33.083
That is why they remain calm in every situation,

68
00:03:33.083 --> 00:03:34.875
and this inner peace

69
00:03:34.875 --> 00:03:37.166
is the proof of their unwavering trust

70
00:03:37.166 --> 00:03:40.208
in Lord Krishna and the depth of their devotion.

71
00:03:40.208 --> 00:03:41.875
And these very qualities make a devotee

72
00:03:41.875 --> 00:03:44.875
most dear to Lord Krishna.

73
00:03:49.083 --> 00:03:52.708
Have you ever noticed how some people

74
00:03:52.708 --> 00:03:55.958
get troubled so easily?

75
00:03:55.958 --> 00:03:58.833
By someone's comment or criticism,

76
00:03:58.833 --> 00:04:03.416
by someone's behaviour, or when a situation

77
00:04:03.416 --> 00:04:07.041
turns out contrary to their expectation,

78
00:04:07.041 --> 00:04:10.000
they become disturbed.

79
00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.083
And you will have also noticed

80
00:04:12.083 --> 00:04:13.333
that some people

81
00:04:13.333 --> 00:04:16.125
often trouble others too,

82
00:04:16.125 --> 00:04:20.708
sometimes deliberately,
and sometimes unknowingly.

83
00:04:20.708 --> 00:04:22.250
If you

84
00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:25.750
truly wish to make spiritual progress,

85
00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:30.041
you must rise above both of these.

86
00:04:30.041 --> 00:04:32.583
True spiritual progress means

87
00:04:32.583 --> 00:04:34.041
learning this,

88
00:04:34.041 --> 00:04:38.750
that by others' behaviour or words

89
00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.541
your mind is not disturbed.

90
00:04:41.541 --> 00:04:43.458
It may be that

91
00:04:43.458 --> 00:04:46.750
someone considers you insignificant,

92
00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:50.833
ignores you, or deliberately

93
00:04:50.833 --> 00:04:53.125
makes some unfair

94
00:04:53.125 --> 00:04:56.666
comment about you.

95
00:04:56.666 --> 00:04:58.041
But

96
00:04:58.041 --> 00:04:59.833
your response

97
00:04:59.833 --> 00:05:03.166
and your peace are in your own hands.

98
00:05:03.166 --> 00:05:04.500
Aren't they?

99
00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:07.166
Think about this, that if

100
00:05:07.166 --> 00:05:12.041
you become disturbed by others' behaviour,

101
00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:14.333
then in a way

102
00:05:14.333 --> 00:05:18.625
you have handed them the key

103
00:05:18.625 --> 00:05:21.291
to your happiness.

104
00:05:21.291 --> 00:05:25.333
Develop your spirituality,

105
00:05:25.333 --> 00:05:29.625
and keep this key to happiness with you.

106
00:05:29.625 --> 00:05:33.291
Let them say what they wish.

107
00:05:33.291 --> 00:05:35.791
They said something bad,

108
00:05:35.791 --> 00:05:38.583
that does not make you bad.

109
00:05:38.583 --> 00:05:42.958
They even wished ill for your future.

110
00:05:42.958 --> 00:05:45.250
So does

111
00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:46.833
this future

112
00:05:46.833 --> 00:05:49.166
depend on them?

113
00:05:49.166 --> 00:05:51.125
No.

114
00:05:51.125 --> 00:05:53.083
Do not be troubled.

115
00:05:53.083 --> 00:05:55.916
And yes, along with this,

116
00:05:55.916 --> 00:05:59.708
one more important point.

117
00:05:59.708 --> 00:06:01.708
Never become the cause

118
00:06:01.708 --> 00:06:05.583
of someone else's pain.

119
00:06:05.583 --> 00:06:10.375
Remember that your words should be gentle,

120
00:06:10.375 --> 00:06:14.875
your behaviour patient.

121
00:06:14.875 --> 00:06:17.250
A calm personality,

122
00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:21.500
one that causes no harm to others,

123
00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:25.583
this is the mark of spiritual maturity.

124
00:06:25.583 --> 00:06:29.333
If you stop being troubled by others,

125
00:06:29.333 --> 00:06:33.291
and also stop troubling others,

126
00:06:33.291 --> 00:06:35.666
then you are slowly

127
00:06:35.666 --> 00:06:38.541
becoming free within.

128
00:06:38.541 --> 00:06:40.666
And in doing so,

129
00:06:40.666 --> 00:06:42.916
you are drawing closer to Me.

130
00:06:47.458 --> 00:06:50.916
Family life is deeply beautiful.

131
00:06:50.916 --> 00:06:53.625
Love, the company of each other,

132
00:06:53.625 --> 00:06:56.541
all of this makes it beautiful.

133
00:06:56.541 --> 00:07:00.083
But sometimes even small things

134
00:07:00.083 --> 00:07:03.208
can disturb this peace of the home.

135
00:07:03.208 --> 00:07:05.666
Someone said something harsh.

136
00:07:05.666 --> 00:07:09.208
You misunderstood someone's behaviour.

137
00:07:09.208 --> 00:07:12.041
Someone did not live up to your expectations.

138
00:07:12.041 --> 00:07:14.000
These small things

139
00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:18.500
many times leave your mind stressed.

140
00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:21.833
So what is the solution?

141
00:07:21.833 --> 00:07:23.583
The solution is

142
00:07:23.583 --> 00:07:27.875
that you simply ask yourself,

143
00:07:27.875 --> 00:07:31.041
what is within your control?

144
00:07:31.041 --> 00:07:34.458
If someone makes a comment,

145
00:07:34.458 --> 00:07:38.083
or does not meet your expectation,

146
00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:42.000
do you give a sharp response?

147
00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.458
If yes, then steady yourself, friend.

148
00:07:45.458 --> 00:07:50.291
Remember, every comment is not an insult,

149
00:07:50.291 --> 00:07:53.500
and everyone learns in their own way,

150
00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:54.958
and moves forward.

151
00:07:54.958 --> 00:07:58.875
It is not necessary that every
word of yours is right,

152
00:07:58.875 --> 00:08:01.375
and that they follow everything you say.

153
00:08:01.375 --> 00:08:05.250
Give up such negative reactions,

154
00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.958
and at the same time, do not yourself

155
00:08:07.958 --> 00:08:12.625
become the cause of someone else's unrest.

156
00:08:12.625 --> 00:08:14.875
If you know

157
00:08:14.875 --> 00:08:16.708
that your words

158
00:08:16.708 --> 00:08:20.375
can hurt someone,

159
00:08:20.375 --> 00:08:21.791
then

160
00:08:21.791 --> 00:08:24.416
what is the point of using

161
00:08:24.416 --> 00:08:26.958
such words?

162
00:08:26.958 --> 00:08:29.375
If you can hold patience,

163
00:08:29.375 --> 00:08:31.958
why create tension, friend?

164
00:08:31.958 --> 00:08:37.083
A peaceful home is not one
where everyone is perfect,

165
00:08:37.083 --> 00:08:39.833
but rather a peaceful home is one

166
00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:44.125
where no one wounds another,

167
00:08:44.125 --> 00:08:46.416
and no one takes offence

168
00:08:46.416 --> 00:08:50.291
at the words of others.

169
00:08:50.291 --> 00:08:52.166
If you adopt this perspective

170
00:08:52.166 --> 00:08:54.750
in family life,

171
00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:59.583
your home will become a temple filled with love.

172
00:09:04.166 --> 00:09:08.208
To find new solutions to difficult problems,

173
00:09:08.208 --> 00:09:12.125
having creative power is absolutely essential.

174
00:09:12.125 --> 00:09:16.166
And do you know what stops

175
00:09:16.166 --> 00:09:20.083
creativity the most?

176
00:09:20.083 --> 00:09:24.416
It is not because of a lack of new skill,

177
00:09:24.416 --> 00:09:28.708
and not from a lack of talent, but rather

178
00:09:28.708 --> 00:09:33.750
a restless mind, a restless mind stops it.

179
00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:36.250
Creativity,

180
00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:39.375
when there is turmoil in thoughts,

181
00:09:39.375 --> 00:09:43.166
then such thinking becomes difficult,

182
00:09:43.166 --> 00:09:46.000
and one who cannot think clearly

183
00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:49.875
cannot find creative solutions either.

184
00:09:49.875 --> 00:09:55.166
What is it that creates turmoil in your mind?

185
00:09:55.166 --> 00:09:57.583
Is it amarsha,

186
00:09:57.583 --> 00:10:01.583
meaning envy of others' success,

187
00:10:01.583 --> 00:10:05.666
which clouds your power of thought?

188
00:10:05.666 --> 00:10:07.375
Or is it bhay,

189
00:10:07.375 --> 00:10:09.416
the fear of losing something,

190
00:10:09.416 --> 00:10:14.458
which holds your steps back? Or Vyakulta?.

191
00:10:14.458 --> 00:10:16.500
That worry about tomorrow

192
00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:19.458
which robs you of today's peace.

193
00:10:19.458 --> 00:10:24.125
If you fall under the sway of these emotions,

194
00:10:24.125 --> 00:10:27.875
they will destroy your energy.

195
00:10:27.875 --> 00:10:31.208
And when energy diminishes,

196
00:10:31.208 --> 00:10:34.708
new thoughts will not arise either.

197
00:10:34.708 --> 00:10:36.333
And the same,

198
00:10:36.333 --> 00:10:40.375
if you learn to manage these emotions,

199
00:10:40.375 --> 00:10:44.500
your mind will remain light,
everything will be seen clearly.

200
00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:48.625
New solutions, new approaches
will begin to emerge.

201
00:10:48.625 --> 00:10:51.750
A steady and calm mind

202
00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.666
is immensely powerful.

203
00:10:54.666 --> 00:10:57.625
When you give up needless emotions

204
00:10:57.625 --> 00:11:01.875
like envy, fear, and agitation,

205
00:11:01.875 --> 00:11:04.041
then you will see

206
00:11:04.041 --> 00:11:07.083
how the creative power within you

207
00:11:07.083 --> 00:11:10.000
begins to grow on its own,

208
00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:15.625
and then how it carries you toward progress.
